{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Last Bet</strong> brings players to the dusty towns of the Wild West with a <strong>first-person action and poker experience</strong>.<br>Join duels in the town square, show your cards at the poker table, and survive against your rivals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Main Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Realistic Duels</strong>: Fast-paced FPS combat that tests your reflexes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2660\ufe0f <strong>Poker Tables</strong>: Texas Hold\u2019em style games combining strategy and luck</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd20 <strong>Wild West Atmosphere</strong>: Horses, towns, saloons, and cowboy culture</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Multiplayer Competition</strong>: Play online with friends or players around the world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2b <strong>Weapon &amp; Character Customization</strong>: Create your own unique style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Open World Elements</strong>: Explore the town, join new duels, and discover the atmosphere</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rely on both your gun and your cards to survive.<br><strong>Win\u2026 or be run out of town!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4060250?t=1762246342","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4060250?t=1762246342","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060250/c843df1d9be09e7db58fdf65e5bc60bea422696e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762246342","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060250/c843df1d9be09e7db58fdf65e5bc60bea422696e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762246342","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1}